  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Localisation support - CEA Boost</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the CEA dedicated support, the existing CEA capacity of Zambia Red Cross will be strengthened with main focus on mainstreaming CEA in the NS, and specifically on closing the feedback loop by engaging communities in the entire Project Management Cycle. As part of the support, a fulltime coordinator for CEA will be engaged to manage and oversee the boosting of CEA interventions and overall mainstreaming of CEA within projects.  Activities planned for include organising training of volunteers on data collection using phones, ensuring that community consultative/feedback meetings are done at all levels of project implementations,  including giving feedback to the community on the performance of the project, broadening of the COVID 19 Dashboard, to include various thematic areas of project implementation beyond current scope.</narrative>
  </description>
